    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "London-based typographic studio founded by John Morgan in 2000; John Morgan died 2 September 2025 at age 52. Studio remains registered and active under directors Teresa Cotovio de Lima, Claire Morgan, and Adrien Vasquez. Kept intentionally small (rarely more than a handful of people; confirmed 2-3 core team as of 2022). Internationally renowned for typography, book/publication design, identity systems for cultural institutions (ArtReview, Raven Row, David Chipperfield Architects, Venice Architecture Biennale, Church of England). Also co-founded Abyme type foundry (2017) with Adrien Vasquez. Work Status set to Studio as the entry represents the practice entity. No Berlin office found; London-only.",
      "source_url": null,
      "verified_at": "2026-07-08T00:28:06",
      "set_by": "agent"
    },
